abstract = {Combat software development is a complex system engineering, and the core components of its various functions are combat models. Starting from the concept of military models, the focus is on the verification and validation of combat software program models, including the work content, methods and techniques of verification and validation, evaluation indicators, and the verification process and result analysis of simulation verification methods. Several thoughts on future model verification and validation are proposed, which can provide ideas and directions for subsequent related research.},
